* wast (https://github.com/wycst/wast)
    Fory's probability-first printable-ASCII fast-path predicate is based in part on WAST's JSON
    string escape predicate.
    Files:
      fory-json/src/main/java/org/apache/fory/json/writer/JsonAsciiWordPredicates.java

